        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.101,
            0.1,
            0.396,
            0.147
          ],
          "content": "\\therefore \\left[ (2 b) 2 + \\left(\\frac {3 \\sqrt {2}}{b}\\right) ^ {2} \\right] + \\left[ (2 b - b) 2 + \\left(\\frac {6 \\sqrt {2}}{b} - \\frac {3 \\sqrt {2}}{b}\\right) ^ {2} \\right] = b ^ {2} + \\left(\\frac {6 \\sqrt {2}}{b}\\right) ^ {2},",
          "image_source": "images/page_0_equation_0.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.103,
            0.153,
            0.141,
            0.171
          ],
          "content": "\\therefore b = \\sqrt {3},",
          "image_source": "images/page_0_equation_1.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.183,
            0.209,
            0.203
          ],
          "content": "\\therefore B (\\sqrt {3}, 2 \\sqrt {6}), D (2 \\sqrt {3}, \\sqrt {6}),",
          "image_source": "images/page_0_equation_2.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.046,
            0.215,
            0.453,
            0.234
          ],
          "content": "∵ 直线 OB 的解析式为:  $y = 2\\sqrt{2}x$ , ∴ 直线 DF 的解析式为:  $y = 2\\sqrt{2}x - 3\\sqrt{6}$ , 当 y = 0 时,  $2\\sqrt{2}x - 3\\sqrt{6} = 0$ ,"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.199,
            0.243,
            0.246,
            0.277
          ],
          "content": "\\therefore x = \\frac {3 \\sqrt {3}}{2},",
          "image_source": "images/page_0_equation_4.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.199,
            0.281,
            0.261,
            0.322
          ],
          "content": "\\therefore F \\left(\\frac {3 \\sqrt {3}}{2}, 0\\right),",
          "image_source": "images/page_0_equation_5.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.199,
            0.328,
            0.296,
            0.363
          ],
          "content": "\\because O E = \\sqrt {3}, O F = \\frac {3 \\sqrt {3}}{2},",
          "image_source": "images/page_0_equation_6.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.199,
            0.367,
            0.3,
            0.401
          ],
          "content": "\\therefore E F = O F - O E = \\frac {\\sqrt {3}}{2},",
          "image_source": "images/page_0_equation_7.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.2,
            0.404,
            0.246,
            0.437
          ],
          "content": "\\therefore \\frac {E F}{O E} = \\frac {1}{2},",
          "image_source": "images/page_0_equation_8.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.047,
            0.444,
            0.143,
            0.485
          ],
          "content": "故答案为: $\\frac{1}{2},\\left(\\frac{3\\sqrt{3}}{2},0\\right)$"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.064,
            0.49,
            0.141,
            0.543
          ],
          "content": "| 得分 |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| 阅卷人 |  |",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
